        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>找出长难句的主干谓语动词的三步骤</title>\n  <style>\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    html,\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      background: #ffffff;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n      color: #1c1c1c;\n    }\n\n    .page {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 540px;\n      height: 763px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding-top: 58px;\n      background: #fff;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .content {\n      width: 456px;\n      margin-left: 42px;\n    }\n\n    .title {\n      margin: 0 0 16px 1px;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      line-height: 1;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      letter-spacing: .4px;\n    }\n\n    .step {\n      display: inline-block;\n      margin: 0 0 11px 0;\n      padding: 2px 5px 2px 2px;\n      font-family: Arial, \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 9px;\n      line-height: 14px;\n      background: #e6f0f8;\n    }\n\n    table {\n      width: 456px;\n      border-collapse: collapse;\n      table-layout: fixed;\n      border: 1px solid #d2e3f0;\n    }\n\n    col.sign-col {\n      width: 84px;\n    }\n\n    col.desc-col {\n      width: 372px;\n    }\n\n    th,\n    td {\n      border-right: 1px solid #caddea;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #caddea;\n    }\n\n    th:last-child,\n    td:last-child {\n      border-right: 0;\n    }\n\n    thead th {\n      height: 39px;\n      padding: 0;\n      background: #dceaf7;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      text-align: center;\n      vertical-align: middle;\n    }\n\n    tbody td {\n      vertical-align: middle;\n    }\n\n    .sign {\n      padding: 5px 5px 5px 7px;\n      background: #dfedf8;\n      text-align: left;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      line-height: 19px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .description {\n      padding: 5px 7px;\n      background: #f8fbfd;\n      font-size: 9px;\n      line-height: 17px;\n    }\n\n    .r1 {\n      height: 103px;\n    }\n\n    .r2 {\n      height: 103px;\n    }\n\n    .r3 {\n      height: 103px;\n    }\n\n    .r4 {\n      height: 92px;\n    }\n\n    .r5 {\n      height: 91px;\n    }\n\n    .rule {\n      margin: 0 0 4px 0;\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n      font-size: 9px;\n      line-height: 17px;\n    }\n\n    .example {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 5px 5px 4px;\n      border: 1px dashed #b8d2e5;\n      background: #ffffff;\n      font-family: \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n      font-size: 9px;\n      line-height: 17px;\n    }\n\n    .highlight {\n      color: #bd7c3d;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      background: linear-gradient(\n        transparent 18%,\n        rgba(255, 218, 124, .43) 18%,\n        rgba(255, 218, 124, .43) 88%,\n        transparent 88%\n      );\n    }\n\n    .strike {\n      color: #333;\n      text-decoration: line-through;\n      text-decoration-thickness: 1px;\n    }\n\n    mark {\n      padding: 0 2px;\n      color: inherit;\n      background: #ffe68b;\n    }\n\n    .insert-layout {\n      display: block;\n      line-height: 23px;\n    }\n\n    .insert-layout mark {\n      padding: 1px 5px;\n    }\n\n    .placeholder {\n      position: absolute;\n      right: 48px;\n      bottom: 49px;\n      width: 104px;\n      height: 74px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: rgba(249, 205, 93, .22);\n      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .75);\n      font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", serif;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      font-style: italic;\n      text-align: center;\n      line-height: 74px;\n      transform: rotate(-12deg);\n      z-index: 0;\n    }\n\n    .page-number {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 0;\n      right: 0;\n      bottom: 48px;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-family: \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n      font-size: 7px;\n      color: #111;\n    }\n  </style>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: {\n        inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n        displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n      }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <section class=\"content\">\n      <h1 class=\"title\">找出长难句的主干谓语动词的三步骤：</h1>\n\n      <div class=\"step\">Step1:看标点，做预判（快速锁定主干的位置——聚焦）</div>\n\n      <table aria-label=\"找出长难句主干的标点预判方法\">\n        <colgroup>\n          <col class=\"sign-col\">\n          <col class=\"desc-col\">\n        </colgroup>\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>标志</th>\n            <th>说明</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr class=\"r1\">\n            <td class=\"sign\">介词等<mark>，</mark></td>\n            <td class=\"description\">\n              <p class=\"rule\">若前半句为介词短语（of……），从句（When……）、非谓语短语（done sth……），则另半句为主干，反之亦然【公式字：双向推理 up】</p>\n              <p class=\"example\">\n                <span class=\"strike\">At the end of adolescence, however,</span>\n                <span class=\"highlight\">the brain shuts down half of that capacity,</span><br>\n                <span class=\"strike\">preserving only those modes of thought that have seemed most valuable during the first decade or so of life.</span>\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <tr class=\"r2\">\n            <td class=\"sign\">主干<mark>：</mark>并列句</td>\n            <td class=\"description\">\n              <p class=\"rule\">分号相当于连词 and, but, or，前半句是主干，后半句是并列句</p>\n              <p class=\"example\">\n                <span class=\"highlight\">Progress in both areas is undoubtedly necessary for the social, political and intellectual development of these and all other societies;</span>\n                <span class=\"strike\">however, the conventional view that education should be one of the very highest priorities for promoting rapid economic development in poor countries is wrong.</span>\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <tr class=\"r3\">\n            <td class=\"sign\">主干<mark>：</mark>定语从句</td>\n            <td class=\"description\">\n              <p class=\"rule\">冒号后面是补充、说明、解释，所以相当于同位语。</p>\n              <p class=\"example\">\n                <span class=\"highlight\">The researchers’ argument stems from a simple observation about social influence:</span>\n                <span class=\"strike\">with the exception of a few celebrities like Oprah Winfrey, whose outsize presence is primarily a function of media, not interpersonal, influence—even the most influential members of a population simply don’t interact with that many others.</span>\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <tr class=\"r4\">\n            <td class=\"sign\">主干<mark>—</mark>同位语</td>\n            <td class=\"description\">\n              <p class=\"rule\">破折号后面是补充、说明、解释，所以相当于同位语。</p>\n              <p class=\"example\">\n                <span class=\"highlight\">Yet the research revealed that the U.S. factories of Honda, Nissan, and Toyota achieved about 95 percent of the productivity of their Japanese counterparts—</span><br>\n                <span class=\"strike\">a result of the training that U.S. workers received on the job.</span>\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <tr class=\"r5\">\n            <td class=\"sign\">\n              <span class=\"insert-layout\">\n                <mark>——插入语</mark><br>\n                <mark>插入语/主干；</mark>\n              </span>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"description\">\n              <p class=\"rule\">主语谓语之间是插入语，而逗号前后为介词短语和分词短语等，中间可能为主干</p>\n              <p class=\"example\">\n                <span class=\"highlight\">Washington</span><span class=\"strike\">, who had begun to believe that all men were created equal after observing the bravery of the black soldiers during the Revolutionary War,</span>\n                <span class=\"highlight\">overcame the strong opposition of his relatives to grant his slaves their freedom in his will.</span>\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">[illegible]</div>\n    <div class=\"page-number\">5</div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
